    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2019 the syndicate's gross claims outstanding were $766.5m. During 2019 the syndicate reported a modest prior-year net release of $3.7m, driven by favourable prior-year claims development across several divisions (notably specialty lines and cyber/executive risk) partially offset by adverse development in reinsurance and some property portfolios. The 2019 underwriting year was impacted by natural catastrophe events (notably Typhoons Hagibis and Faxai) but these were within expected ranges; there was also some loss creep on earlier catastrophe events such as Typhoon Jebi and Hurricane Maria. The reported $3.7m figure in the managing agent's narrative appears to be a net (after reinsurance) prior-year release; no gross prior-year movement figure was provided explicitly in the notes.",
